# project: wedding-next-june
// Wedding planned for next June. Venue first, then guest list, vendors,
// invitations, RSVPs, and final headcount. Venue contingency both sides
// of the deposit.

VAR pushback_rounds = 0

-> venue_touring

=== venue_touring ===
Tour candidate venues until we find one we both love.
Done when a venue clears the bar for both of us.
+ [No winner yet, keep touring] ~loop~ -> venue_touring
+ [We both love this one] @human -> book_venue

=== book_venue ===
Book the chosen venue with a deposit; paying the deposit locks the wedding date.
+ [Pay the deposit, date locked] @human -> guest_list_drafting
+ [Venue falls through before the deposit] ~loop~ -> venue_touring

=== guest_list_drafting ===
Draft the guest list with both families and gather the parents' input.
Parents can push back a couple of rounds before we close it out.
~ pushback_rounds += 1
+ {pushback_rounds <= 2} [Parents push back, run another round] ~loop~ -> guest_list_drafting
+ [Families are aligned enough] -> guest_list_final_call
+ [Venue falls through] -> venue_insurance

=== guest_list_final_call ===
The two of us make the final call on the guest list.
+ [Final guest list locked] @human -> caterer_tastings
+ [Venue falls through] -> venue_insurance

=== caterer_tastings ===
Run caterer tastings until one stands out to both of us.
+ [Not the one, book another tasting] ~loop~ -> caterer_tastings
+ [We pick this caterer] @human -> photographer_search
+ [Venue falls through] -> venue_insurance

=== photographer_search ===
Meet and shortlist photographers until we find our match.
+ [Keep looking] ~loop~ -> photographer_search
+ [Book this photographer] @human -> send_invitations
+ [Venue falls through] -> venue_insurance

=== send_invitations ===
Send the invitations four months before the wedding date.
+ [Invitations are out] -> chase_rsvps
+ [Venue falls through] -> venue_insurance

=== chase_rsvps ===
Chase outstanding RSVPs until the responses are in.
+ [Still waiting on replies, keep chasing] ~loop~ -> chase_rsvps
+ [RSVPs are in] -> final_headcount
+ [Venue falls through] -> venue_insurance

=== final_headcount ===
Give the final headcount to the caterer three weeks before the wedding.
+ [Caterer has the final headcount] -> wedding_day
+ [Venue falls through] -> venue_insurance

=== wedding_day ===
The wedding itself; everything is locked and delivered.
-> END

=== venue_insurance ===
The booked venue has fallen through after the deposit.
Work the wedding insurance conversation and decide together how to recover.
+ [Rebook a new venue] @human ~loop~ -> venue_touring
+ [Change the date and rebook] @human ~loop~ -> book_venue
